# ===================================================================================================
# Part B URLs without a version keep working: they are served as v1 and carry the deprecation headers.
# ===================================================================================================

### Unversioned (served as v1): 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shipments/APX-10000001

### Unknown version: 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v3/shipments/APX-10000001
